		["Tap **EQUIP** to equip the sword."] = "**\236\158\165\236\176\169**\236\157\132 \237\131\173\237\149\180 \236\185\188\236\157\132 \236\158\165\236\176\169\237\149\152\236\132\184\236\154\148.",
