		["You reached the top of the bamboo again, but its ry\197\141 is done for today ({count} a day)."] = "Has vuelto a llegar a la cima del bamb\195\186, pero sus ry\197\141 se acabaron por hoy ({count} al d\195\173a).",
		["A lucky climb! You reached the top of the bamboo again: +{ryo}."] = "\194\161Una escalada con suerte! Has vuelto a llegar a la cima del bamb\195\186: +{ryo}.",
